      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "SMART MINX (8) jumps from box 8 again after scoring (22.89) last time at this track over 400m. Safe beginner but wide box to overcome and will need some luck. Expected to go close again. GOOD ODDS KEONA (1) turned in a fair 4th placed finish last time at this track over 400m (23.33). Has ability and can measure up. MIGHTY SAVANNAH (2) put in a much better performance last start when in the placings at this track behind SMART MINX (23.30) in a Grade 5. Settled off speed and worked to the line nicely. Expected to be in the finish again. DAISY'S CHARM (7) is a last start winner who rates one of the chances again.",
